<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and</p>
<p>gilts were steady to $0.50 Higher. Demand was moderate with a</p>
<p>light to moderate movement. Top $47.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  46.00-47.50 few 45.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  41.00-45.50</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  36.00-41.00</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 39.00-43.00 few 38.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 44.00-47.00 few over 600 lbs. 48.50</p>
</text>
